Hi,

I've been "playing" around with the different versions of milo on my
Ruffian system. But whatever I tried none of the prebuild versions
available at

ftp://ftp.alphalinux.org/pub/Linux-Alpha/Miniloader/v2.2/

are working for me. The symptom is always the same. The system freezes
after the line.

....
... Jumping to linux kernel
-----------------------------

The older milo versions found at

ftp://genie.ucd.ie/pub/alpha/milo/

are working.

I've read from people on this list using milo 2.2-X sucessfully. Any
ideas what can cause the problems?
My ldmilo.exe is version 1.1 (Jays Hacked Version) from
ftp.alphalinux.org

I have a SCSI only system using the onboard SymLogic. My boot kernel is
2.2.18.

Regards

Max Weninger 
