> [root@rglinux2 ~]# su - reid
> su: user reid does not exist
>=20
> This is the problem, why is user reid not found?

What does your /etc/nsswitch.conf say ? It should contain lines like
passwd:         files nis
group:          files nis
shadow:         files nis

so nis is actually used.

