You're right, it probably doesn't support IDE either...

The old Digital Semiconductor EB boards (CABRIO/EB66/EB164/PC164/LX164/SX164)
were the earliest ones to support IDE; of the workstations, MIATA (DPW/PWS)
was first, IIRC. Most of the EV6-bases boxes do, specifically for IDE CDROM.

